.TH dalgona-help-dev 1  "dalgona-help-dev " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-help\-dev \- Inspect and drive sessions for debugging.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona help dev\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and drive sessions for debugging.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-help\-dev\-run(1)
Drive a scripted headless session from a scenario file (one step JSON per line).
.TP
dalgona\-help\-dev\-journal(1)
Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.TP
dalgona\-help\-dev\-fold(1)
Print which folded fields each journal record changes.
